@startuml
title End-to-End Dataset Factory Sequence

skinparam shadowing false
autonumber

actor Maintainer
participant "scripts.collect_all" as CollectCLI
participant "Collectors" as Collectors
database "data/raw" as Raw
participant "scripts.synthesize" as SynthCLI
participant "Planner + PromptBuilder" as Planner
participant "GeminiClient" as Gemini
participant "Phase 3 validators" as V3
database "data/synthesized/<run>" as SynthOut
participant "scripts.quality_filter" as QualityCLI
participant "Phase 4 quality" as Quality
database "data/quality/<run>" as QualityOut
participant "scripts.package_dataset" as PackageCLI
participant "Packager" as Packager
database "data/packaged/<run>" as PackageOut
participant "scripts.finetune" as TrainCLI
participant "Unsloth LoRA SFT" as Trainer
database "data/finetune" as FinetuneOut
participant "scripts.run_evaluation" as EvalCLI
participant "Target model client" as Target
participant "Local LLM judge" as Judge
database "data/evaluation/<run>" as EvalOut
participant "scripts.compare_evaluations" as CompareCLI

Maintainer -> CollectCLI: python -m scripts.collect_all
CollectCLI -> Collectors: run selected or all collectors
Collectors -> Raw: write <source>/<source>.jsonl
Collectors -> Raw: write collection_manifest.json

Maintainer -> SynthCLI: validate-raw
SynthCLI -> Raw: read raw JSONL
SynthCLI -> Maintainer: report file, document, issue counts

Maintainer -> SynthCLI: run --mode subset
SynthCLI -> Planner: select docs and assign category/difficulty
Planner -> Raw: load RawDocument rows
Planner -> Planner: apply source profiles and compactors
Planner -> Gemini: one prompt at a time
Gemini -> V3: structured JSON output
V3 -> V3: schema, reasoning, grounding, indicators, mappings
V3 -> SynthOut: accepted.jsonl or rejected.jsonl
Gemini -> SynthOut: raw_outputs.jsonl
SynthCLI -> SynthOut: prompts.jsonl and generation_manifest.json

Maintainer -> QualityCLI: quality_filter
QualityCLI -> Quality: validate candidate pairs
Quality -> Raw: load source documents
Quality -> Quality: row gates, scoring, dataset gates
Quality -> QualityOut: filtered, review, rejected, sample, manifest

Maintainer -> PackageCLI: package_dataset
PackageCLI -> Packager: load filtered rows
Packager -> Packager: validate filtered status
Packager -> Packager: assign 75% reasoning / 25% direct
Packager -> Packager: transform GLM response view
Packager -> Packager: split by source_doc_id
Packager -> PackageOut: train, validation, test, manifest

Maintainer -> TrainCLI: finetune --config configs/finetune_glm47flash_v3.yaml
TrainCLI -> Trainer: load package and training config
Trainer -> PackageOut: read train and validation JSONL
Trainer -> FinetuneOut: checkpoints, adapter, GGUF, training manifest

Maintainer -> EvalCLI: run_evaluation
loop one held-out case at a time
  EvalCLI -> Target: generate target response
  Target --> EvalCLI: prediction
  EvalCLI -> Judge: case, prediction, answer key, rubric, variants
  Judge --> EvalCLI: validated JSON verdict
  EvalCLI -> EvalOut: atomically refresh all run artifacts
end

Maintainer -> CompareCLI: compare calibrated base and tuned runs
CompareCLI -> EvalOut: load complete compatible judge scorecards
CompareCLI -> EvalOut: write JSON and Markdown comparison

@enduml
